{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23757","headline":"重答汝州李六使君见和忆吴中旧游五首 · 白居易","name":"重答汝州李六使君见和忆吴中旧游五首","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爲忆娃宫与虎丘，翫君新作不能休。\n蜀牋写出篇篇好，吴调吟时句句愁。\n洛下林园终共住，江南风月会重游。\n由来事过多堪惜，何况苏州胜汝州。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23757.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23757","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}